  "content": "<div><img src=\"https://imgur.com/qjonte2.png\" alt=\"Formations Overworld横幅\" width=\"1903\" height=\"797\"></div><div>&nbsp;</div><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Formations Overworld</strong> 为各种主世界生物群系添加了大量新建筑！</h3><div>&nbsp;</div><div><img src=\"https://imgur.com/yl2Gq3d.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></div><div>&nbsp;</div><h4><strong>建筑</strong></h4><h5>以下是一些在 Formations Overworld 中可找到的建筑示例。更多图片，请查看图片画廊。</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/697/310/172/bamboo_hut.png\" alt=\"丛林中的竹屋\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/712/310/172/tower_remnant.png\" alt=\"旧塔的遗迹\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/714/310/172/desert_houses.png\" alt=\"沙漠中的小房子\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/722/310/172/wagon.png\" alt=\"被雪覆盖的马车\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"></p><div>&nbsp;</div><div><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ksGhYpe.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></div><div>&nbsp;</div><h4><strong>常见问题</strong></h4><h5><strong>我能在我的整合包中使用你的模组吗？</strong></h5><h5>是的，欢迎在我的整合包中使用这个模组。</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/TNtFe30.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>Discord</strong></h4><h5>想了解未来内容、即将推出的模组及进行讨论，欢迎加入SuperMartijn642的Discord服务器！</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QEbGyUYB2e\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IG1us6p.png\" alt=\"Discord加入按钮\" width=\"373\" height=\"93\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/iLGGqDH.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/tsJvc9x.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/M8GKFFk.png\" alt=\"分隔线\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p>",
